    {
      "jobId": "60333f13-db07-485c-a13d-63d156c9b816",
      "question": "How many issuers are in each sector, and what was each sector's median return over the 20 trading sessions ending August 31, 2026?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-02T18:25:05.549084Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T18:29:12.954139Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "| Sector | Issuers | Median 20‑session return* |\n|---|---|---|\n| Construction | 41 | **3.96 %** |\n| Finance, Insurance and Real Estate | 425 | **4.22 %** |\n| Manufacturing | 792 | **3.27 %** |\n| Mining | 119 | **‑2.09 %** |\n| Retail Trade | 138 | **0.23 %** |\n| Services | 304 | **‑0.74 %** |\n| Transportation, Communications, Electric, Gas and Sanitary Services | 181 | **‑0.50 %** |\n\n\\*Return is calculated as the median of each issuer’s total return over the 20 trading sessions ending 31 Aug 2026 (adjusted‑close on 31 Aug 2026 ÷ adjusted‑close 20 sessions earlier – 1). Values are shown as percentages (the raw fractions from the query are multiplied by 100).\n\n[1]\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Structured retrieval result — synthetic_market — evidence `hermes-receipt:45ff581e488d51ef3f837348c29a58386fb35863bed12ce08c6a7d112a903310`",
